  "id": "assessment",
  "term": "assessment",
  "definition": "Assessment is the clinical process of evaluating a patient’s condition in a structured way, such as establishing a baseline, asking direct questions, and following up over time. In this context, it helps distinguish problems that were present before treatment from difficulties that emerged during treatment.",
